  <title>Lesson Overview</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m01590</md:content-id>
    <md:title>Lesson Overview</md:title>
    <md:uuid>71090a31-3e52-4a72-bb08-e9ec8eedfb07</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section id="sect-00001"><para id="para-00001">In this lesson, you will multiply different types of polynomials. You will learn methods to multiply binomials by other binomials. You will learn different methods to multiply polynomials by other polynomials, including using polynomial functions.</para>
<para id="para-00002">Polynomials are frequently used in calculating physics problems and other real-world situations involving projectiles and the motion of objects. Mastering the polynomial operations in this unit will help you in future studies.</para>
<para id="para-00003">When you finish this lesson, you will be able to:</para>
<list id="list-00001">
  <item>Multiply monomials.</item>
  <item>Multiply a polynomial by a monomial.</item>
  <item>Multiply binomials.</item>
  <item>Multiply a polynomial by a polynomial.</item>
  <item>Multiply special products.</item>
  <item>Multiply polynomial functions.</item>
</list>
<para id="para-00004">Here are the <emphasis>activities</emphasis> that will help you reach those goals:</para>
<list id="list-00002">
  <item>6.2.1: Multiplying Monomials</item>
  <item>6.2.2: Multiplying Binomials
    <list id="list-00003">
    <item>6.2.2: Self Check</item>
    <item>6.2.2: Additional Resources</item>
  </list></item>
  
  <item>6.2.3: Multiplying a Polynomial by a Polynomial
    <list id="list-00004">
    <item>6.2.3: Self Check</item>
    <item>6.2.3: Additional Resources</item>
  </list></item>
  
  <item>6.2.4: Multiplying Special Products
    <list id="list-00005">
    <item>6.2.4: Self Check</item>
    <item>6.2.4: Additional Resources</item>
  </list></item>
  <item>6.2.5: Multiplying Polynomial Functions</item>
</list>
<para id="para-00005">After that, you’ll <emphasis>practice and review</emphasis>.</para>
<list id="list-00006">
  <item>6.2.6: Practice</item>
  <item>6.2.7: Lesson Summary</item>
</list></section>
</content>
